## Hook Requirements by Type

### Complexity Hooks (UserPromptSubmit)
```bash
✅ No requirements
✅ Always runs
✅ Analyzes prompt text only
```

### Code Quality Hooks (PostToolUse Write|Edit)
```bash
✅ Git repository initialized
✅ At least 2 commits (need HEAD~1)
✅ Java files changed in last commit
```

**Setup**:
```bash
cd ~/your-project
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"

# Now hooks will work on subsequent commits
```

### Pre-Commit Hooks (PostToolUse Bash git commit)
```bash
✅ Git repository
✅ Staged files (git add)
✅ Running git commit command
```

