## Hook Status Messages

When hooks run in Claude Code, you see status messages:

### Before Hook Runs
```
"statusMessage": "Checking SOLID principles..."
```

Displays in your terminal while hook executes.

### After Hook Completes
Hook output is shown (the ════════ banners and checklists).

### If Hook Exits Early
No output (silent exit when conditions not met).

