## Debugging Hooks

### Check Hook is Configured
```bash
cat ~/.claude/settings.json | grep -A 10 "hooks"
```

Should show PostToolUse hooks for Write|Edit and Bash.

### Check Hook is Executable
```bash
ls -la ~/team-claude-config/hooks/post-code/
```

Should show `-rwxr-xr-x` (executable).

### Run Hook with Debug
```bash
cd ~/your-project
bash -x ~/team-claude-config/hooks/post-code/api-standards-check.sh
```

Shows every line executed with `+` prefix.

### Check Git Setup
```bash
# Check git repo exists
git status

# Check commits exist
git log --oneline -3

# Check what changed in last commit
git diff HEAD~1..HEAD --name-only
```

### Check Pattern Matching
```bash
# What files changed?
git diff HEAD~1..HEAD --name-only

# Do they contain REST annotations?
git diff HEAD~1..HEAD | grep -E "@RestController"
```

