## Expected Behavior Summary

### Normal Claude Code Session

```
1. You type prompt
2. UserPromptSubmit hook runs (complexity check)
3. You see hook output immediately
4. Claude processes prompt
5. Claude uses Write/Edit tool
6. PostToolUse hooks run automatically
7. You see hook output (SOLID, domain, API checks)
8. Claude continues with response
```

### This Conversation

```
1. You type prompt
2. UserPromptSubmit hook runs ✅ (you saw complexity check)
3. I use Write/Edit tool ✅
4. PostToolUse hooks run ❓ (but output not captured in chat)
5. You can manually run hooks to see output
```

