## Troubleshooting

### "No output when I run hook"

**Cause**: Hook exited early (no matching files)

**Check**:
```bash
git diff HEAD~1..HEAD --name-only
# Do you see Java files?

git diff HEAD~1..HEAD | grep -E "@RestController"
# Do you see REST annotations?
```

### "Hooks not running automatically"

**Cause**: Hooks configuration not loaded

**Fix**:
```bash
# Check settings
cat ~/.claude/settings.json

# Should have hooks section with PostToolUse
```

### "Hook shows errors"

**Cause**: Missing dependencies or permissions

**Check**:
```bash
# Test hook directly
bash ~/team-claude-config/hooks/post-code/api-standards-check.sh

# Check permissions
ls -la ~/team-claude-config/hooks/post-code/*.sh
# Should show -rwxr-xr-x
```

